      "cwe_id": "CWE-89",
      "explanation": "The change adds type validation (isinstance check) for band index values before they are used in SQL query construction. This is a defensive improvement that prevents non-integer values from reaching SQL generation. The error message uses only the class name (not user-controlled data) in a TypeError, never in SQL. No new SQL construction paths are introduced.",
